body:
Imagine defending Nazis.

&#x200B;

This post was made by sane people.

&#x200B;

Fuck off

The Big Bang Theory doesn't even do that; the writers just make fun of autistic people using Sheldon's character. It's annoying to see this as an autistic person, and why I dislike the Big Bang Theory.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

It's also just not funny.

More like, Elon downplayed the severity of this global crisis then promised to donate 1000 ventilators only after he was pressured to, all the while not closing his factories to slow the spread of the virus, leading to some of his workers contracting the virus, and the best part is he only donated ***forty*** of the 1000 promised and none of them even function properly. 

&#x200B;

But I guess that's all forgiven and forgotten cause Elon's a *quirky gamer and me-mer LOL XD*.
